stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> S0_LangDetect

    S0_LangDetect: State 0 - Detect Language\n(Arabic script check on incoming text)
    S0_LangDetect --> S1_Greeting

    S1_Greeting: State 1 - Greeting + Intent\n"Book appointment or ask a question?"
    S1_Greeting --> FAQ: Intent = Question
    S1_Greeting --> S2_Service: Intent = Booking
    S1_Greeting --> Handoff: Off-script / medical / complaint / pricing

    FAQ: Answer from FAQ list
    FAQ --> S1_Greeting: loop back to intent

    S2_Service: State 2 - Which service?
    S2_Service --> S3_Timing
    S2_Service --> Handoff: Off-script

    S3_Timing: State 3 - Preferred day/time
    S3_Timing --> S4_Slots
    S3_Timing --> Handoff: Off-script

    S4_Slots: State 4 - Offer available slots\n(mocked calendar for Phase 1)
    S4_Slots --> S5_Confirm: Slot chosen
    S4_Slots --> S3_Timing: None work, ask again

    S5_Confirm: State 5 - Confirm booking\n(service + date + time summary)
    S5_Confirm --> [*]

    Handoff: Human Handoff\nMedical/health, complaints,\npricing negotiation, off-script
    Handoff --> [*]: escalated to human, bot stops

    note right of S1_Greeting
        Every state has EN + AR versions.
        Bot detects language switch mid-chat
        and replies in the new language.
    end note

    note right of S4_Slots
        No-reply nudge timers run in parallel
        from the last user message:
        +1h  -> free-form nudge
        +24h -> template message (Meta approval needed)
        +72h -> final template, then mark as lost
    end note
